// VS Code REST Client: run each with 'Send Request'

### Health
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Process (text)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/process
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

text=Total: INR 1200 | Paid: 1000 | Due: 200

### Extract (text)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/extract
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

text=Total: INR 1200 | Paid: 1000 | Due: 200 | Discount: 10%

### Normalize
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/normalize
Content-Type: application/json

{ "tokens": ["1200","1000","200","10%"] }

### Classify
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/classify
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Total: INR 1200 | Paid: 1000 | Due: 200", "numbers": [1200,1000,200] }
